{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55646","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十四 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万境闲来情淡淡，羣嚣息後思微微。\n当时白业无门入，今日玄关有路归。\n熟果不摇翻自落，生禽谁唤却惊飞。\n到头何用空忙得，任运应须待对机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}